<header class="rm-head"><h1>Settings</h1><p>Manage your business, team and StockChief preferences.</p></header><div class="sc-settings-layout"><%- include('navigation',{section:'advanced',sections}) %><div class="sc-settings-content" data-settings-section="advanced"><h2>Company sign-in</h2><p>Connect your OpenID Connect identity provider on a Custom plan. Password sign-in stays available.</p>
<% const c=sso.configuration; %><section class="card card-body stack"><h3><%= c?.label||'Company identity provider' %></h3><p role="status"><%= c?.enabled?'Enabled':'Not enabled' %> · <%= sso.linked?'Your identity is linked':'Your identity is not linked' %></p><% if(c){ %><label class="field">Company sign-in code<input class="input" readonly value="<%= c.id %>"></label><button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="<%= c.id %>">Copy company code</button><% } %><label class="field">Registered redirect URI<input class="input" readonly value="<%= callbackUri %>"></label><button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="<%= callbackUri %>">Copy redirect URI</button><% if(c?.enabled&&sso.allowed){ %><form method="post" action="/settings/company-sign-in/link"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="field">Current StockChief password<input class="input" name="currentPassword" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><p>Confirm that you trust this company's identity provider to sign you into this company's inventories. An email match alone never links an identity.</p><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit"><%= sso.linked?'Confirm or replace my linked identity':'Link my company identity' %></button></form><% } %></section>
<% if(!sso.allowed){ %><section class="card card-body"><h3>Company sign-in is available on Custom</h3><p><a class="btn" href="/contact?plan=enterprise">Email us about company sign-in</a></p></section><% } %><% if(sso.isOwner&&sso.allowed){ %><section class="card card-body stack"><h3>Identity provider settings</h3><p>Register StockChief as a confidential OpenID Connect client with authorization-code flow and S256 code verification. Copy the redirect URI above to your provider. Secrets are encrypted and never shown again. Changing settings revokes existing company sessions and requires members to confirm their links again.</p><form method="post" action="/settings/company-sign-in" data-settings-form><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= c?.revision||0 %>"><label class="field">Company sign-in name<input class="input" name="label" maxlength="80" value="<%= c?.label||'' %>" required></label><label class="field">Issuer address<input class="input" name="issuer" type="url" maxlength="500" placeholder="https://your-identity-provider.example" value="<%= c?.issuer||'' %>" required></label><label class="field">Client ID<input class="input" name="clientId" maxlength="500" value="<%= c?.client_id||'' %>" required></label><label class="field">Client secret<input class="input" name="clientSecret" type="password" maxlength="4000" autocomplete="new-password" <%= c?'':'required' %>></label><% if(c){ %><p>Leave the secret empty to retain the saved secret.</p><% } %><label><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" value="1" <%= c?.enabled?'checked':'' %>> Enable company sign-in</label><label class="field">Current StockChief password<input class="input" name="currentPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Save</button></form><% if(c?.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/settings/company-sign-in/disable"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= c.revision %>"><label class="field">Current StockChief password<input class="input" name="currentPassword" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Disable company sign-in and revoke its sessions</button></form><% } %></section><% } %></div></div><script src="/settings-sections.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
